  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-21",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "请荣思伦出手保卫新节目  (Calling In a Favor to Save Charming Voyage)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Focusing first on saving Charming Voyage before Xie Ling can persuade network executives to cancel it, Bu Xiaogu lays out a two-pronged counterattack with Xingzi and Kaiwen. Listen to their Mandarin plan first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在最要紧的就是阻止这件事发生，绝对不能让魅力远航下马。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "关于谢灵的财务问题，我觉得我们可以先埋下一些伏笔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这个伏笔我来埋，你们俩负责保住魅力远航就行了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你已经有什么计划了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你还记着当时荣思伦给我们的许诺吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你打算找他帮忙？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得是时候请荣先生还我们这个人情了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "荣先生那边都是自己人，用不着那么客气，真的要感谢他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐真厉害，这么快就已经说好了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但是如果电视台内部另有阻力，到时候怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "徐胖说谢灵要绕过邓主任，直接找电视台高层的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那咱们第一步，也要在电视台找一个能说话的人！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在最要紧的就是阻止这件事发生，绝对不能让魅力远航下马。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What matters most right now is stopping this; we must never let Charming Voyage get axed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "关于谢灵的财务问题，我觉得我们可以先埋下一些伏笔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for Xie Ling's financial misconduct, I think we can quietly lay the groundwork first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这个伏笔我来埋，你们俩负责保住魅力远航就行了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will lay that groundwork myself, while you two focus on protecting Charming Voyage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你已经有什么计划了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you already have a plan in mind?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你还记着当时荣思伦给我们的许诺吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi, do you remember the promise Rong Silun made to us back then?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你打算找他帮忙？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you planning to call on him for help?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得是时候请荣先生还我们这个人情了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think it is time to ask Mr Rong to return that favor he owes us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "荣先生那边都是自己人，用不着那么客气，真的要感谢他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Rong treated us like family with zero fuss—we really owe him our thanks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐真厉害，这么快就已经说好了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi, you are amazing—you got it arranged already!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "但是如果电视台内部另有阻力，到时候怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet what if there is still internal resistance inside the network when the time comes?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "徐胖说谢灵要绕过邓主任，直接找电视台高层的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xie Ling's deputy said Xie Ling is going around Director Deng directly to someone higher up at the network.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那咱们第一步，也要在电视台找一个能说话的人！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then our first move must be finding our own voice inside the television network too!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
